{"unit_id":"tag:02WI:prose-0005","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n在引理的情形下，对任意如引理中所述的态射（morphism）<MATH_0001>，说 <MATH_0002> 具有性质 <MATH_0003> 是有意义的，这里性质可为定义 <REF_0001> 中所述的任意一项。特别地，这适用于 <MATH_0004>“满射（surjective）”和 <MATH_0005>“平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）”，见上面的注记 <REF_0002>。我们将在下面的代数空间（algebraic spaces）定义中使用这一注记。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"当前词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"当前词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"当前词表未批准；原重音 token 保留。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"当前词表未批准。"}],"notes":[]}
