{"unit_id":"tag:0CB7:proof","translation":"由引理 <REF_0001> 可知 <MATH_0001> 可表（representable）。可以将条件 (2) 表述为变换（transformation）<MATH_0002> 具有性质 <MATH_0003>，见引理 <REF_0002>。考虑 <MATH_0004> 和 <MATH_0005>。注意，有交换图（commutative diagram）<MATH_0006>，其中两个方块都是笛卡尔的（cartesian）。由此可见，态射（morphism）<MATH_0007> 是某个具有性质 <MATH_0008> 的态射（morphism）沿 <MATH_0009> 的基变换（base change）。由于 <MATH_0010> 在基变换（base change）下保持，证明完成。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表"},{"source_term":"transformation","target_term":"变换"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图"},{"source_term":"cartesian","target_term":"笛卡尔的"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表","context":"当前词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"transformation","target_term":"变换","context":"当前词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图","context":"当前词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"cartesian","target_term":"笛卡尔的","context":"当前词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"当前词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换","context":"当前词表未批准。"}],"notes":[]}
