{"unit_id":"tag:025Y:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 是包含在 <MATH_0002> 中的概形（scheme）。一个<TEXTITOPEN_0001><MATH_0003> 上的代数空间（algebraic space）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>是预层（presheaf）<MATH_0004>，具有下列性质：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 预层（presheaf）<MATH_0005> 是层（sheaf）。\n<STRUCT_0003> 对角（diagonal）态射（morphism）<MATH_0006> 可表（representable）。\n<STRUCT_0004> 存在概形（scheme）<MATH_0007> 及映射（map）<MATH_0008>，它是满射（surjective）且平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）<FOOTNOTEOPEN_0001>见引理 <REF_0001>、定义 <REF_0002> 和注记 <REF_0003>。<FOOTNOTECLOSE_0001>\n<STRUCT_0005>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"diagonal","target_term":"对角"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"当前词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"当前词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层","context":"当前词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"当前词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"diagonal","target_term":"对角","context":"当前词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"当前词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表","context":"当前词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"当前词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"当前词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"当前词表未批准；重音 token 保留。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:025X:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n这与“通常的”定义，例如 Knutson 著作 <REF_0001> 中的定义，有两点不同。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n第一点是，我们要求 <MATH_0001> 是 fppf 拓扑（topology）下的层（sheaf）。这样做的一个原因是，许多自然的代数空间（algebraic spaces）例子对 fppf 覆盖（coverings）（甚至 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc coverings））满足层条件（sheaf condition）。另外，代数空间（algebraic spaces）之所以如此有用，一个原因在于 Michael Artin 关于代数空间（algebraic spaces）的结果。他的方法中内含一项条件，保证所得结果在 <MATH_0002> 上局部有限表现（locally of finite presentation）。综合这些方面，我们觉得 fppf 拓扑（topology）似乎是开展工作的自然拓扑（topology）。最终，所得代数空间（algebraic spaces）范畴（category）是相同的，见《Bootstrap》第 <REF_0002> 节。\n\n<STRUCT_0004><STRUCT_0005>\n第二点是，对 <MATH_0003> 的对角（diagonal）映射（map），我们只要求它可表（representable），而 <REF_0003> 还要求它拟紧（quasi-compact）。若 <MATH_0004>，其中 <MATH_0005> 是 <MATH_0006> 上的某个概形（scheme），这就对应于要求 <MATH_0007> 拟分离（quasi-separated）。我们的观点是，尝试仅假定 <MATH_0008> 的对角（diagonal）可表（representable），来证明后面的一些结果，并在必要时补充一项假设。无论如何，这样做有一个令人满意的结果：下面的引理成立。\n\n","allowed_english":["Knutson","Michael","Artin","Bootstrap","fppf","fpqc"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"fpqc coverings","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖"},{"source_term":"sheaf condition","target_term":"层条件"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限表现"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"diagonal","target_term":"对角"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"quasi-separated","target_term":"拟分离"},{"source_term":"diagonal","target_term":"对角"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"当前词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"当前词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"当前词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖","context":"当前词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"fpqc coverings","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖","context":"当前词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"sheaf condition","target_term":"层条件","context":"当前词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限表现","context":"当前词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"当前词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"diagonal","target_term":"对角","context":"当前词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"当前词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表","context":"当前词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧","context":"当前词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"当前词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"quasi-separated","target_term":"拟分离","context":"当前词表未批准。"}],"notes":[]}
